    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>1st-level warlock feature</em></p><p>You have spent long hours researching and practicing forbidden knowledge, gaining the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You can speak, read, and write Eredun.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on Intelligence checks made to recall information about aberrations, fiends, and undead.</p></li><li><p>You apply your proficiency bonus when you make a Charisma check while interacting with fiends, or twice your proficiency bonus if you are proficient in the skill.</p></li></ul>",
